BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:BIDA Afternoon Jane Austen Country Dance and Evening Contra Dance
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251019T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251019T223000
DTSTAMP:20261030T094249Z
UID:4635c8ea-69cc-5652-919e-740faeb4b47d
DESCRIPTION:This dance has mask-optional and mask-required portions 3:00-6
 :00 English Country Dance mask-optional 6:00-7:00 Potluck mask-optional 7:
 00-7:30 Contra Lesson mask-required 7:30-10:30 Contra Dance mask-required 
 In honor of Jane Austen's 250th Birthday later this year\, BIDA and CDS-Bo
 ston Centre are hosting a joint English Country Dance and Contra Dance eve
 nt. Jane Austen Birthday English Country Dance Sliding scale: $10-20 Tom R
 oby calling\, footwork lesson by Corinne Holroyd Music by Emily O’Brien\
 , Catherine Miller\, and Jean Monroe Contra Dance Sliding scale: $5-20 Isa
 ac Banner calling to Eloise & Co.
END:VEVENT
