DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260104T223000
DTSTAMP:20261030T094249Z
UID:0c29b707-1aeb-5e58-ac8f-e0d153a5d9ac
DESCRIPTION:4:00-6:30 Experienced Dance\; 6:30-7:30 Potluck\; 7:00-7:30 Be
 ginner's Lesson\; 7:30-10:30 Evening contra dance. What do you mean experi
 enced ? Should I come?? For the afternoon advanced session\, Maia will cal
 l trickier material with less teaching than usual. If you are confident do
 ing a no-walkthrough and know how to get back on track with grace when mis
 takes happen on the floor you should be good! Maia McCormick calling to Re
 d Case Band. This dance is mask-optional.
END:VEVENT
